Wed Oct 28 06:39:15 UTC 2026 - Martin Pluskal <mpluskal@suse.com>

- Update to version 1.13.0:
  * Drop Python 3.10 support, add Python 3.15 support
  * Remove legacy integer backward compatibility for
    SpecialTokenPolicy
  * Reject multiple tool results in tokenizer v2, treat null
    strict as the default in Function.from_openai
  * Add response_format support to model settings and
    generated chat templates
  * Add reasoning effort levels, configurable chat template
    defaults and a GrammarFactory single-pass grammar entry
    point
  * Honor cache_dir when listing cached tokenizers, fix HF Hub
    offline fallbacks and HTML-escaped tool-call JSON
  * Raise the pydantic floor to 2.12, as upstream now requires

-------------------------------------------------------------------
Wed Sep 23 18:49:10 UTC 2026 - Martin Pluskal <mpluskal@suse.com>

- Update to version 1.12.0:
  * Allow overriding auto-detected plain thinking support,
    reference audio filename for speech uploads, keep one
    pixel per axis on image resize, reject bad AudioConfig
  * Drop the carried LICENSE copy: upstream renamed LICENCE
    to LICENSE, the sdist ships it again

-------------------------------------------------------------------
Wed Sep 23 07:12:56 UTC 2026 - Martin Pluskal <mpluskal@suse.com>

- Add the missing python-pycountry dependency: the tokenizers
  import pydantic_extra_types.language_code, which needs it
- Switch from update-alternatives to libalternatives
- Extend %check to import the tokenizer, catching missing runtime
  dependencies

